title: NewYarnScript
---
<<declare $kaede_affection = 0>>
<<declare $inori_affection = 0>>
<<set $read_notebook to false>>

<<show_date_cutscene "Day1">>
<<play_bgm "daily1">>
<<vn_set_background "playerRoom">>
<<play_sfx "phone_ring">>
Hiragi: ......
Hiragi: (A shrill ring drags my mind up from somewhere deep and dark.)
Hiragi: (My eyelids refuse to open.)
Hiragi: (--just five more minutes.)
Hiragi: (.....)
: (Brrring--brrring--)
Hiragi: (The sound won't let up, and I finally crack my eyes open.)
Hiragi: "Who is it... bothering someone this early... so rude."
Hiragi: (Still comfortably curled up, I fumble for the phone on the nightstand.)
Hiragi: "Mm..."
Hiragi: (I finally get a grip on it — everything's still blurry, I just want to sleep... wait, is the phone...)
<<stop_sfx>>
<<play_sfx "drop">>
: (--thud!)  
Hiragi: "Ow?!"
Hiragi: (The phone landed square on my forehead...)
Hiragi: (What is going on... Woken up by some random call, and now beaned by my own phone. What kind of morning is this.)
Hiragi: (Full of questions, I unlock my phone.)
Hiragi: "--Inori?"
Hiragi: (Seeing that painfully familiar name, I can't help but frown.)
Hiragi: (I skim the messages — "you're going to be late if you don't get up"...?)
Hiragi: "--!"
Hiragi: (It hits me what day it is, and suddenly my head clears right up.)
Hiragi: "What time is it?!"
Hiragi: (8 o'clock...!)
Hiragi: (I launch myself out of bed and sprint into the bathroom.)
Hiragi: (Staring at my rat's-nest hair, I claw at it in a panic.)
Hiragi: "I'm not going to make it...! It's only the fourth day of the new term...!"
<<play_sfx "openDoor">>
Hiragi: (I throw my hair and uniform into some kind of order and bolt out the door.) 
<<vn_set_background "road">>
<<play_sfx "running">>
Hiragi: (Being late before the first week's even up would be too pathetic...!)
Hiragi: (Thank god Inori kept calling... hm?)
<<stop_sfx>>
Hiragi: (Who's that over there...?)
<<stop_sfx>>
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
Hiragi: (A girl is crouched at the mouth of the alley, a handful of cats scattered around her.)
Hiragi: (She doesn't seem the least bit bothered by the cats crowding her — her expression hasn't shifted once.)
Hiragi: (Perfectly calm, unreadable the whole time.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
Hiragi: (She's really popular with them... I didn't think the cats around here were that friendly to people... wait, no! I'm going to be late!)
Hiragi: (And she's wearing the same uniform as me... could she be a lost first-year?!)
Hiragi: (I can't just walk past...!)
Hiragi: (I turn and take a step toward her.)
Hiragi: "Um... are you lost, by any chance?"
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
Kaede: "......"
Hiragi: (At my question, her hand pauses mid-pet, but she goes right back to fussing over the cat like nothing happened.)
Hiragi: (Didn't she hear me? Or is she just shy...?)
Hiragi: "If you're lost, we could walk to school together — we go to the same one, after all."
Hiragi: (My somewhat frantic words land on deaf ears; she doesn't budge.)
Hiragi: (No matter how I try to talk to her, she shows no sign of acknowledging me.)
Hiragi: (Well, that's that... if this keeps up I'm really going to be late, so I have to go.)
Hiragi: "I'm about to be late... I'll head off first if that's okay!"
Hiragi: (Without waiting for a reply, I take off running.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
<<play_sfx "running">>


<<vn_set_background "classroom day">>
<<stop_sfx>>
Hiragi: (Made it!)
<<play_sfx "schoolBell">>
: Ding-dong-- 
Hiragi: (I reach my seat a split second before the bell finishes ringing.)
Hiragi: (I made it--!)
<<stop_sfx>>
Hiragi: (I drop my bag on the desk and collapse into my chair with everything I've got left.)
Hiragi: "So tired..."
Hiragi: (I let out a breath, trying to catch it.)
Hiragi: (The person in front of me turns around, a grin tugging at his mouth.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
<<play_voice "Inori_konnichiwa">>
Inori: "Morning, Hiragi. Good thing you made it."
Hiragi: "Oh... Inori! Morning!"
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "I was going to wait and walk with you, but after a while you still weren't up and about, so I figured you'd overslept."
Inori: "I sent a few messages, and when you still didn't respond, I just went on ahead."
Hiragi: "You really do know me best...! I completely forgot school had started again — I was still half asleep! Thank god you called, or I'd have missed the day entirely! You're my lifesaver."
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Inori: "The lifesaver who left you behind, you mean."
Hiragi: (Inori's smile is warm, laced with just a bit of teasing.)
Hiragi: (He's my childhood friend — we grew up together since elementary school.)
Hiragi: (We weren't nearly this close back then, but somewhere along the way, we just... got close. Really close.)
Hiragi: (Speaking of Inori, he's exactly the kind of kid parents brag about to their own — the "other people's child.")
Hiragi: (Gentle, dependable, top grades... honestly, the guy doesn't seem to have a single flaw.)
Hiragi: (No wonder he's held onto a spot in the top ten of last year's "Most Wanted to Date" ranking without fail.)
Hiragi: (Even the kitchen is basically his second home... my mom's always going "Look at Inori, then look at you," like she's ready to just adopt him on the spot.)
Hiragi: (Which makes me want to ask — Mom, do you really think that little of your own kid?)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
Hiragi: (And yet, someone this perfect turned out to be the childhood friend who grew up right beside me! Honestly, I still don't fully get how our friendship has lasted this long — we don't even have that much in common.)
Hiragi: (Anyway...)
: (Growl--) 
Hiragi: (Guess sprinting here full-speed left me starving...)
Hiragi: (Class only just started, lunch is still a long way off... no choice but to tough it out for now.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "...Hiragi? Why are you spacing out?"
Hiragi: (Inori looks at me, a little worried, and it snaps me back to reality.)
Hiragi: "It's nothing! Just — running here at full speed wasn't exactly kind to my stomach this early in the morning."
Hiragi: (Sprinting on an empty stomach really was too much to ask of it.)
Inori: "It'd be bad if you got a stomachache."
Hiragi: (With that, he pulls a bag of bread out of his bag and hands it to me.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Hiragi: "Figured running all that way would burn through your energy, so I picked some up beforehand. Good thing I did, huh."
Hiragi: "Oh! That's — the red bean filled bun from Minamino Bakery! Fresh every morning, only thirty made a day!"
Hiragi: "I've wanted to try this for ages... Inori really does know me best! I don't even have to say it out loud and he already gets it!"
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "Yeah. Figured you'd love it. Glad I got it right."
Hiragi: (Inori really is dependable and gentle. Like he can read my mind. We know each other so well that half the things between us never even need saying, because the other just gets it.)
Hiragi: (He really is too sweet... if only there were a hundred of him.)
Hiragi: (I open the bun, determined to get at least a few bites in before the teacher walks in.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>


Teacher: "All right, all right, settle down, it's time for class."
Hiragi: (The teacher walks in, and the once-noisy classroom quiets down.)
Hiragi: (There seems to be someone trailing behind the teacher — someone who wasn't in this class before... huh?)
Hiragi: (Isn't that... the girl from earlier?!)
Teacher: "This is our new transfer student. I expect you all to get along with her. Go ahead and introduce yourself."
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
<<play_voice "Kaede_konnichiwa">>
The unfamiliar girl: "I'm Kishizawa Kaede. Nice to meet you."
Hiragi: (She gives a small nod, her expression as unreadable as ever, calm and giving nothing away.)
Hiragi: (So she really is the transfer student... and she's in my class, too.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
Teacher: "All right, Kishizawa, take the seat over there. Let's begin class!"
Hiragi: (She walks over to the seat by the window and settles in slowly.)
Hiragi: (Even though this morning's still on my mind... I should focus on the lesson for now.)


<<play_sfx "schoolBell">>
Hiragi: (Class is finally over...!)
Hiragi: (I stretch, and right on cue my stomach growls.)
: Growl--
<<stop_sfx>>
Hiragi: (Guess I really did overdo it running this morning... I'm hungrier than usual.)
Hiragi: (Right then, Inori stands up from his seat and waves me over.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "Want to grab something to eat at the store? I could use a snack too."
Hiragi: "Sure, let's go."
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
<<vn_set_background "corridor day">>
Hiragi: (We head out of the classroom together, toward the convenience store.)
Hiragi: (As we walk, Inori suddenly turns back to look at me.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "So, what were you even doing last night? You almost missed the bell today — that's rare for you."
-> Got way too into a game...
-> Wanted to soak in the night air...
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Inori: "Ha — you always say the most random things, Hiragi."
<<vn_hide_sprite>>

<<vn_set_background "stairs day">>
Hiragi: (Walking alongside Inori, chatting, we head toward the convenience store.)
Hiragi: "So... what should we get for break? Anything you're in the mood for?"
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Inori: "Nothing in particular — I'll go with whatever you want."
Hiragi: (We're still debating when we round the hallway corner.)
Hiragi: "So then..."
Hiragi: (The next second, before I can even react, I slam straight into someone coming the other way.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
<<play_sfx "drop">>
: thud!
<<play_voice "Kaede_confused">>
? : !
<<stop_sfx>>
Hiragi: "Ow...!"
Hiragi: (Everything in the other person's arms clatters to the floor.)
Hiragi: "Oh — I'm sorry! I wasn't looking. Are you okay?"
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "confused">>
Hiragi: (I look up to apologize properly, and realize it's the transfer student from this morning.)
Hiragi: "Huh, it's you...!"
Hiragi: (Kaede says nothing, just looks down at the mess scattered across the floor.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
Hiragi: (Inori and I crouch down to help gather everything up.)
Hiragi: (An orientation booklet, some textbooks, and...)
Hiragi: (A notebook, its edges worn soft with use, lying face-down on the floor.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "Is this... a sketchbook?"
Hiragi: (I pick it up, and just as I'm about to hand it back to Kaede, I can't help sneaking a glance.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
->Ask about it
    Hiragi: "Do you draw?"
    <<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
    : (Kaede's hand pauses for a beat. I wait for an answer.)
    : (But she just takes the sketchbook back without a word and walks off.)
    <<play_sfx "walk">>
    <<vn_hide_sprite>>
    <<stop_sfx>>
->Don't ask, just hand it back
    Hiragi: (Though curious, I decide not to ask and just hand everything back to her.)
    Hiragi: "Here's everything — sorry again for bumping into you."
    <<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "smile">>
    Hiragi: (Kaede takes it, glances at me, gives a small nod, and walks off without a word.)
    <<set $kaede_affection += 1>>
    <<play_sfx "walk">>
    <<vn_hide_sprite>>
    <<stop_sfx>>

<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "Seems like a pretty quiet one, huh."
Hiragi: "Yeah... I hope I didn't scare her or something."
Inori: "I doubt it's about you, Hiiragi — she's probably just introverted. Don't worry about it too much."
Hiragi: (His words settle me a bit, and we head on toward the store.)
<<play_sfx "walk">>
 <<vn_hide_sprite>>
<<stop_sfx>>

<<vn_set_background "street">>
Hiragi: (After school, Inori suggests trying out a newly opened restaurant.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "I heard there's a new place near here — want to check out their menu?"
Hiragi: "Sure, I could use a little treat right about now."
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
<<vn_set_background "cafeinner">>
Hiragi: (We walk in side by side, and a server greets us with a smile.)
Server: "Table for two? We've actually got a couples' set on special right now — would you like to hear about it?"
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Hiragi: (I blink, then glance over at Inori.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
->Play along
    Hiragi: "Uh... yeah, we're together. What's in the couples' set?"
    <<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
    Hiragi: (Inori looks briefly startled, but quickly goes along with it, smiling.)
    <<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
    Inori: "That's right — go ahead and tell us about it."
    <<set $inori_affection += 1>>
    <<vn_hide_sprite>>
    (The server happily walks us through the set, and we end up ordering along with the flow of it.)
->Deny it
    Hiragi: "Oh, no — we're just close friends. Could you recommend something else instead?"
    <<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
    Inori: "......"
    (Inori looks at me for a beat, but quickly smiles that gentle smile of his again.)
    <<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
    Inori: "That's right, just good friends."
    (The server looks a little embarrassed and quickly switches to recommending something else.)
    <<vn_hide_sprite>>

Hiragi: (Whatever we ended up ordering, we talked plenty over the meal and spent a genuinely nice evening together after school.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "Honestly, the new dish was surprisingly good."
Hiragi: "Yeah, we should come back sometime."
Hiragi: (We share a smile and wrap up dinner.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>

<<vn_set_background "playerRoomN">>
Hiragi: (After getting ready for bed, I lie there, unable to quiet my thoughts.)
Hiragi: (For some reason, the image of the transfer student crouched by the alley, watching that cat, keeps surfacing in my mind.)
Hiragi: (Along with that worn, dog-eared sketchbook of hers...)
Hiragi: (I wonder what she draws.)
Hiragi: (And then...)
Hiragi: (I think about the look on Inori's face right after the server said what she said — like there was something he almost said, but didn't.)
Hiragi: "Am I overthinking it...?"
Hiragi: (I go back and forth, but come up with nothing. I let out a sigh.)
Hiragi: (Fine, if I keep at this I won't fall asleep, and I can't afford to be late again tomorrow.)
Hiragi: (I roll over, close my eyes, and slowly drift off.)



<<jump Day2>>
===

title: Day2
---
<<show_date_cutscene "Day2">>
<<play_bgm "daily3">>
<<vn_set_background "playerRoom">>
Hiragi: (Determined not to be late again, I'm up before even the third alarm I set goes off.)
Hiragi: (After washing up, I check myself in the mirror.)
Hiragi: "Yeah, looking good — time to head out."
<<play_sfx "phonevibrate">>
: (Ding--)
Hiragi: (My phone buzzes. It's a message from Inori.)
<<stop_sfx>>
Inori: < Figured you'd be up by now. I'm waiting outside! ^^ >
Hiragi: (Reading it, I can't help but smile a little.)
Hiragi: "This guy, always so thoughtful."
Hiragi: (I grab my bag and head out the door.)
<<vn_set_background "housePlayer">>
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Inori: "Morning, Hiragi. Right on time today."
Hiragi: "Of course — I'm not looking to repeat yesterday's disaster."
Hiragi: (We walk side by side down the familiar route to school, chatting on and off.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
Hiragi: (When we reach the mouth of that alley, I unconsciously slow my steps and peer inside.)
Hiragi: (Empty — nothing there but a few lazy cats.)
Hiragi: (Today... the transfer student isn't here.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "Something wrong?"
Hiragi: (Noticing me stop, Inori follows my gaze.)
Hiragi: "Oh, it's nothing."
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
Hiragi: (I brush it off and pick up my pace again.)
Hiragi: (So she's not there every day, huh...)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "......"
<<vn_hide_sprite>>

<<vn_set_background "classroom day">>
Hiragi: (The bell rings for break, and I notice Kaede's already gotten up and slipped quietly out of the room.)
Hiragi: (Before I can think much about it, two familiar bento boxes suddenly appear in front of me.)
Hiragi: (Boxes I've known by heart since middle school.)
Hiragi: "Don't tell me this is—!"
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Hiragi: (Inori nods, smiling.)
Inori: "Found an interesting recipe online recently — wanted your opinion on it, so I made some today too."
Hiragi: "Thanks... sorry to keep putting you through the trouble."
Hiragi: (I take the box, thanking him, but my mind wanders.)
Hiragi: (This childhood friend of mine has loved cooking since he was little — the second he spots some interesting recipe online, he gets excited to try it out.)
Hiragi: (I still remember back in middle school, he "kidnapped" me into being his official taste-tester, always earnestly asking for my thoughts and how he could improve.)
Hiragi: (And somewhere along the way, he started "accidentally" making too much, or making a point of cooking whatever I liked.)
Hiragi: (He really is dependable...)
Hiragi: "Inori's going to make someone a really dependable partner someday..."
Hiragi: (The moment it's out of my mouth, I realize I actually said that out loud.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "Hm... partner?"
Hiragi: (He looks at me, a little confused.)
Hiragi: "Huh? Did that slip out?"
Hiragi: (I scramble to cover.)
Hiragi: "I mean — yeah, Inori's just really dependable."
Hiragi: "Not just kind, but you looks after people, and you can cook... honestly, that's basically boyfriend material, right?"
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Inori: "You're rating me way too highly — most people could pick this stuff up with a little practice."
Hiragi: "Not everyone can get this good at it! Wasn't there that 'most wanted to date' ranking last year? You placed top five!"
Hiragi: (I tease him.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "Don't laugh at me, Hiragi."
Hiragi: "Seriously, why haven't you found anyone?"
Hiragi: "Honestly, I can't even picture you dating someone."
Hiragi: "What's your type, anyway?"
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Inori: "Hmm... you'll find out eventually."
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Hiragi: "Come to think of it — have you ever had a first love?"
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Hiragi: (I ask offhand. Inori just smiles.)
Inori: "What do you think?"
Hiragi: "Every time you say it like that, it means you've already decided not to tell me!"
Hiragi: (Right as I start to press further, the class bell rings.)
Hiragi: "Ugh, you got lucky."
Hiragi: (We drop the topic and settle back into our seats.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>


<<vn_set_background "corridor afternoon">>
Hiragi: (After school, I've been assigned cleaning duty, so I tell Inori to head home without me.)
Hiragi: (Once the classroom's tidy, I step out of the staff room.)
Hiragi: "Thanks, sir — I'll head off now."
Hiragi: (Walking toward the gate, something occurs to me.)
Hiragi: (Knowing Inori, he's probably not headed straight home — more likely he's parked himself in the library.)
Hiragi: "Might as well go check there first."
<<vn_set_background "artroom afternoon">>
Hiragi: (Passing by the art room, I catch a glimpse of Kaede still inside, still drawing.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "smile">>
Hiragi: (It's this late already — why is she still here...)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
<<vn_set_background "corridor afternoon">>
Hiragi: (But barging in on her doesn't feel right, so I keep walking, heading straight for the library.)
<<vn_set_background "library afternoon">>
Hiragi: (Sure enough, the moment I step inside, I spot Inori tucked in a corner, deep in a book.)
Hiragi: (A mischievous idea pops into my head — I creep up behind him and poke his shoulder.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Hiragi: (But Inori barely reacts, just turns around to look at me.)
Inori: "Oh, done with cleanup? Give me a second, I'll pack up."
Hiragi: (With that he starts gathering his things.)
Hiragi: "Seriously? How did you not even flinch?"
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Inori:  "No, Im startled."
Hiragi: "There's no way that counts as startled."
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
Hiragi: (Bickering the whole way, we leave the library together.)
<<vn_set_background "road">>
Hiragi: (Walking home, something crosses my mind.)
Hiragi: "There's this new movie that came out recently — it's kind of caught my interest."
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "Oh yeah? What's it about?"
Hiragi: "The story's apparently about the main character being liked by both their childhood friend and someone they met later, so they have to make a choice — but no matter which one they pick, it might end up hurting the other person... something like that."
Hiragi: "That's what the synopsis said, anyway. I'm really curious what the main character ends up choosing, and what happens along the way."
Inori: "That does sound pretty interesting."
Hiragi: (Chatting away, we reach the fork in the road before we realize it.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Inori: "Well — see you tomorrow."
Hiragi: "Yep, see you!"
Hiragi: (We wave goodbye and head off toward our own homes.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>

<<jump Day3>>

===

title: Day3
---
<<show_date_cutscene "Day3">>
<<play_bgm "daily3">>
<<vn_set_background "classroom day">>
Hiragi: (As usual, Inori and I walk to school together.)
Hiragi: (The moment I sit down, Inori turns to face me.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "Hey — are you free this Sunday?"
Hiragi: "What's up?"
Inori: "That movie you mentioned before — I entered a promo raffle yesterday and somehow ended up with a buy-one-get-one ticket."
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Inori: "Want to go check it out together next Sunday?"
Hiragi: (The mention of that movie instantly perks me up.)
Hiragi: "Really? Yes, absolutely — I've been dying to know how it ends!"
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "normal">>
Inori: "Then it's settled. We'll sort out the time and place later."
<<vn_show_sprite "Inori" "bigsmile">>
Hiragi: (We share a smile, happily locking in the plan.)
<<vn_hide_sprite>>

<<play_bgm "daily4">>
<<play_sfx "schoolbell">>
Hiragi: (The bell rings for break. I stretch and decide to head to the courtyard for some fresh air.)
<<stop_sfx>>
<<vn_set_background "courtyard day">>
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
Hiragi: (Walking in, I spot a familiar figure sitting on a bench, drawing.)
Hiragi: "Oh, it's that transfer student from the other day."
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
Hiragi: (Just as I'm about to quietly approach, a gust of wind suddenly blows through.)
: *fwip--*
Hiragi: (It flips open the sketchbook resting on her lap, and I catch a glimpse without meaning to.)
Hiragi: (Looks like she's sketching the big tree in the courtyard, along with two classmates chatting in the distance.)
Hiragi: (The wind dies down, and right as it does, she looks up — our eyes meet head-on.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
Kaede: "..."
"..."
Kaede: "..."
"..."
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "confused">>
Kaede: "You saw?"
Hiragi: (I finally snap out of it.)
Hiragi: "I just got here — I swear I wasn't trying to peek!"
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
Kaede: "Is that so."
<<vn_hide_sprite>>
Hiragi: (With that, she looks back down and keeps drawing, no longer paying me any attention.)
Hiragi: (Should I say something else...?)
->Compliment her drawing
    Hiragi: "So — Kishizawa, you're really good at drawing... is that a club thing?"
    <<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
    Hiragi: (Kaede stays silent for a beat.)
    Hiragi: (Did I make her mad...?)
    Hiragi: (Just as I'm starting to worry, she finally speaks.)
    Kaede: "...It's a hobby."
    <<vn_hide_sprite>>
    Hiragi: (And then she falls silent again.)
->Ask her to teach me drawing
    Hiragi: "...Could you teach me to draw?"
    <<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
    Hiragi: (Kaede glances up at me.)
    <<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "confused">>
    Kaede: "Have you drawn before?"
    Hiragi: "No... but I suddenly felt like trying it?"
    <<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
    Kaede: "..."
    Hiragi: (Kaede goes quiet again for a beat.)
    Kaede: "Is that so."
    <<vn_hide_sprite>>
    Hiragi: (With that, she ignores me completely — seems like a no.)

Kaede: "......"
Hiragi: "......"
Hiragi: (What do I do, this is so awkward! Should I say something!)
Hiragi: (Just as I'm getting anxious, Kaede suddenly speaks.)
<<vn_show_sprite "Kaede" "normal">>
Kaede: "...You're in the way."
